   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, cloud/fb-quickwins-reviewer-opus, round 1): REQUEST CHANGES**, head 60155c1\n\n1. **Medium**, `App/SwiftHFR/Root/RootTabsView.swift:68`. The tab root runs at regular width on a foldable's inner screen (GAP-215, `tabSplitSizeClass` keeps `.regular`). There the Catégories split shows all three columns, so `ForumListView` (`:66`, `.accountMenuToolbarItem()`) and the topics column (now `showsAccountMenu: true`) each draw an avatar, side by side. Legacy shows one there: its sidebar has none (`MainWindow.swift:1880-1902` @ 87fe0d1c). Fix: in `TopicsColumn`, show the button only when the split is collapsed (`horizontalSizeClass == .compact`; `TabSplitWidth` already sets that value inside the columns).\n2. **Medium**, `App/SwiftHFRTests/Accounts/AccountMenuPlacementTests.swift:164-176`. The test only checks `TopicListView`'s flag. If `showsAccountMenu: true` is removed at `RootTabsView.swift:68` or `:166` (the real fix), every test stays green (L01). Fix: host `CategoriesTabView` with `selectedSource` set, and `FavoritesTabView` with `openedCategory` set, in the compact 402-pt window. Expect exactly one leading item: that also catches a duplicate on the Favoris root.\n3. **Low**, `AccountMenuPlacementTests.swift:52-57` + `:173`. `readBars` stops at the first `isOnTheLeft`, and `leftControls` can become true from the back button alone. In the `true` case the loop can stop before SwiftUI installs the leading item: `leftItems == 0`, and the test fails at random. Fix: in this test, poll until `leftItems > 0` or the timeout.\n4. **Low**, PR body `### Ledger`, GAP-009. \"after the back button of a category's topic list\" is wrong on iPad: the topic list pushed in `CategoriesSidebarColumn` (`RootSidebarView.swift:171`) has no avatar. Legacy's iPad list column has one (`MainWindow.swift:1932-1938` → `:803-818`). Fix: port it there, or limit the text to the iPhone tab root and track the iPad case on #893. The block parses (`ledger.py check-body`: 1 block ok). Also consider adding `MainWindow.swift:803-818 @ 87fe0d1c` to `Legacy ref`.\n\n**Vérifié**\n- Read the diff and the legacy code at 87fe0d1c (`ForumTopicsListView` toolbar, iPad `selectedIPadListContent`, sidebar).\n- Checked the duplicate-button cases: Favoris root, the iPhone compact split, iPad sidebar root, the foldable tab root.\n- Checked the memberwise init order, `if` inside `.toolbar`, and line lengths (none over 140).\n- Ran `ledger.py check-body` on the PR body.\n- Not run: the app cannot be built on Linux, and the PR does not compile-check it yet.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
